{"mt_tconst": "two-days-one-night", "mt_cr": ["Entertainment Weekly", "Chris Nashawaty"], "mt_cr_review_score": 91, "mt_cr_review_date": "Jan  3, 2015", "mt_cr_review": "With her wide, sad eyes and quiet air of embarrassment tinged with pride, Cotillard's Sandra is asking a question not only of her colleagues but of the audience, too: Are we willing to put aside our own self-interest for the sake of empathy? Are we cowardly or brave? Cotillard's exquisite performance makes you feel every ounce of the weight of that dilemma.", "mt_cr_review_full_url": "http://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20887885,00.html", "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/movie/two-days-one-night/critic-reviews", "spider": "mt_cr_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
